  "changes": [
    "Merged upstream 0.1.69 changes onto 0.1.64 local customizations.",
    "Upgrade all runtime modules to upstream 0.1.64 (including first-turn client system prompt placement, 400 fail-fast on turned-away prompts, isolated --gemini-dir, multi-model concurrency, run_command toolSummary conflict fix, and startup diagnostics/install support)",
    "Preserve the local live tool-result plus assistant-prefill extension and incomplete parallel-result rejection",
    "Adopt upstream MCP commit-aware delivery rather than duplicating results already committed to the kept session",
    "Retain transcript-based model-step usage by default and independent ACP input/cache counters; SQLite accounting is available with transcript usage disabled",
    "Retain opt-in raw ACP and response-usage diagnostics without logging message contents"
